# iCloud conflict copies. Syncing this folder leaves duplicates named
# "header 2.html", "lottie 2/", "pay-224 2.webp" and so on, counting up from 2.
# They are stale copies of files the site already has, and they do real damage:
# build.py globs blog/*.html, so three of them were published as live sitemap
# URLs pointing at older versions of our best-ranking pages (26 Oct 2026), and a
# git add -A swept forty more into the repository the same day.
# If you ever need one back, it is a copy. Take it from git history instead.
* 2
* 2.*
* [3-9]
* [3-9].*
